## Development Guidelines

### Code Style

- **TypeScript strict mode** (no implicit any)
- **Functional components** with hooks (no class components)
- **Early returns** for readability
- **Descriptive naming** (handleClick, isLoading, etc.)
- **Const over function** for component definitions

### Component Patterns

- **Server Components by default** (data fetching, static rendering)
- **Client Components** only when needed (interactivity, hooks, browser APIs)
- **"use server"** for Server Actions (mutations)
- **"use client"** for Client Components (explicit boundary)

### File Organization

- **Feature-based folders** (components/chat/, components/sidebar/)
- **Colocation** (hooks near components that use them)
- **Separation of concerns** (actions/, lib/, data/)

### Accessibility

- **ARIA attributes** on all interactive elements
- **Keyboard navigation** (Tab, Enter, Escape)
