## Technical Decisions & Rationale

### Why OpenRouter?

- Multi-model flexibility without vendor lock-in
- Single API for 10+ providers
- Cost optimization (switch to cheaper models)
- No need to manage multiple API keys

### Why Redis?

- Significant performance improvement (80% fewer DB queries)
- Optional (app works without it)
- Easy to add/remove (graceful degradation)

### Why Server Actions over API Routes?

- Less boilerplate for simple CRUD
- Type-safe by default (TypeScript inference)
- Automatic revalidation (revalidatePath)
- Better DX (no need to define endpoints)

### Why Supabase?

- Built-in authentication (OAuth, magic links)
- PostgreSQL with RLS (security at DB level)
- Real-time subscriptions (future feature)
- Generated TypeScript types
- Good free tier for development

### Why Tailwind v4?

- Zero-config setup
- Better performance (native CSS)
- Smaller bundle size
- Future-proof (cutting edge)

